      "title": "Student Worker - Athletics James Work Gym",
      "description": "Posted: 2026-08-21\n\nLocation: Doylestown\n\nJob Summary: We are looking for a student to join our Athletics Team! Essential Duties and Responsibilities: Daily practice laundry (mostly in the evenings) Wash and dry and put away gear Game day laundry when needed Set up and break down gymnasium for Volleyball games Set up and break down the gymnasium for Basketball games Set up and break down wrestling matches Put away game uniforms after wash is done Help with basketball field dragging and raking when needed Help with women’s lacrosse practice set up and breakdown Help with meet and greet JV and varsity football officials for home games Help out in any area of the athletic department when needed Other duties as assigned Education Employment eligibility: Currently enrolled Delaware Valley University student Must be authorized to work in the United States and provide required documentation to verify identity and employment eligibility Must include updated resume Reliable Willing to work evenings and weekends Dependable Good communication skills Physical Requirements and Working Conditions:  Outdoor exposure to weather May have an alternative work schedule May be required to be on call Typically standing or walking Occasionally lifting Typically bending., crouching, stooping Occasionally lifting 25 lbs or less Frequently lifting 25 lbs or more",
