      "title": "Student Worker - Fields/Stadiums",
      "description": "Posted: 2026-08-17\n\nLocation: Doylestown\n\nJob Summary: This position is responsible for helping with the set up a for practices and game days.  Essential Duties and Responsibilities: Set up game fields and some practice fields. Move goals and benches Turning on clocks for games/practices Mostly outside events in the fall, indoor in the winter, outside in the spring. Other duties as assigned Education Employment eligibility: Currently enrolled Delaware Valley University student Must be authorized to work in the United States and provide required documentation to verify identity and employment eligibility Preferred Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: Good communication Time management Dependable Work as a team Physical Requirements and Working Conditions :  Prolonged periods of sitting at a desk and working on a computer. Occasionally lifting 25 lbs or less Frequently lifting 25 lbs or more Typically standing or walking Typically bending, crouching, stooping Climbing ladders, scaffolds Typically running, climbing Using tools requiring high dexterity Outdoor exposure to weather Exposure to chemicals Exposure to moving machinery Exposure to unpleasant odors High noise environment High dust, dirt, grease environment Must hold valid driver’s license May have an alternative work schedule",
