      "title": "Adjunct Pool Master's Speech-Language Pathology Graduate Program",
      "description": "Posted: 2024-06-18\n\nLocation: Doylestown\n\nDelaware Valley University is currently searching for part-time adjunct faculty to teach a variety of speech-language pathology courses in its new online Speech Language Pathology program. We maintain a file of potential candidates that we review when a specific need arises. We contact candidates when a match is identified and keep these positions continually posted in order to maintain an active and up to date pool.   Position Requirements:  Masters level degree (PhD or EdD preferred) or higher in healthcare, business or applicable field from a regionally accredited university is a requirement  Demonstrated teaching excellence   Experience working with diverse populations    Selected applicants will be responsible for providing the University with clearances, appropriate to the position, that have been completed within the last 5 years. These clearances could include but are not limited to the Pennsylvania State Police Criminal Record Check.   Delaware Valley University is an equal opportunity employer and proud of our commitment to a diverse workforce.",
